        "original_id": "5af01852-a773-5f36-966b-26a659673248",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Theme Park, Theme Park World, Theme Park Inc., Sim Theme Park\n- Companies: Bullfrog Productions, Electronic Arts\n- Topics: Theme Park series, construction and management simulation games\n\nFacts:\n- Theme Park started the Theme Park series in 1994.\n- Theme Park World, also known as Theme Park 2 and in North America as Sim Theme Park, is a 1999 construction and management simulation game.\n- Bullfrog Productions developed Theme Park World.\n- Electronic Arts released Theme Park World.\n- Theme Park World continued the Theme Park series in 1999.\n- Theme Park Inc. is the last game in the Theme Park series.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
